  "title": "Túpac Amaru II",
  "summary": "Born José Gabriel Condorcanqui in the Cuzco region, Túpac Amaru II began an uprising against Spanish rule on 4 November 1780 by capturing the local administrator Antonio de Arriaga. He and his family were captured by mid-April 1781, and he was executed on 18 May 1781 in the Plaza de Armas in Cuzco.",
